  "description": "A company wants to use a role to access an S3 bucket in another account. Which TWO permission areas should it review?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>문제 풀이</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 089</p><h1>문제 풀이</h1></div><strong>89 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"89번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:82%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q089\" data-question=\"Q089\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2,4\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q089</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to use a role to access an S3 bucket in another account. Which TWO permission areas should it review?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only NAT gateway availability</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the S3 storage class</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The role trust policy and permission to call AssumeRole</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the EC2 instance size</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">The target bucket policy and the role&#x27;s S3 permissions</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C, E</strong> · 교차 계정 역할을 맡을 수 있어야 하고, 맡은 뒤 리소스 액세스 정책도 맞아야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q088/\">이전 문제 <b>Q088</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q090/\">다음 문제 <b>Q090</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
